# VS Code REST Client scratchpad — install humao.rest-client and click "Send Request".
@base = http://localhost:8000

### health
GET {{base}}/health

### chat via the mock provider (no API key needed)
POST {{base}}/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Summarise the leave policy." }],
  "model": "mock-fast",
  "metadata": { "task_type": "summarise" }
}

### routing policy — 501 until GW-003
POST {{base}}/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "hello" }],
  "policy": "default"
}

### prometheus metrics
GET {{base}}/metrics
